    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Public Tender - Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) Implementation of an AI assistance solution for hospital staff 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must let staff quickly access reliable, up-to-date information drawn from the authority's internal procedures, care protocols and HAS recommendations, applicable regulatory texts, and internal documents (guides, notes, reference frameworks, drug references)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Potential risks in this tender include the complexity of integrating with existing hospital information systems, ensuring data sovereignty and security, and meeting the required response times for common queries." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, our company's experience and expertise in these areas can help mitigate Potential risks in this tender." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Opportunities in this tender include the potential to demonstrate our company's capacity for innovation, provide a high level of quality of service, and contribute to reducing energy consumption and environmental footprint." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging our company's strengths and addressing the client's requirements and constraints, our company's can submit a competitive proposal that showcases our company's value proposition and differentiates our company's from other bidders." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, our company's PM methodologies, past public sector references, consortium partners, available capacity, and governance practices align well with the needs of this tender, and our company's are confident that our company's can deliver a successful project that meets the client's requirements and expectations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires response times below 2 seconds for common queries, high availability (99.9%), integration with existing hospital information systems (SIH) and electronic patient records (DPI), and compliance with health interoperability standards (HL7, FHIR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How does our current technology stack meet these requirements, and what adaptations or improvements would be necessary to ensure full coverage? our current platform, Atelier, is a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform that can address some of the client's requirements. our have a median latency of 1.3 seconds and common queries p95 latency below 2 seconds, which meets the response time requirement." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our current platform, Atelier also has built-in monitoring, logging, and observability, which can help ensure high availability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding integration with existing hospital information systems (SIH) and electronic patient records (DPI), our architecture and integration capabilities include standard connectors and custom adapters for SIH and DPI integration, as well as support for health interoperability standards such as HL7 and FHIR through our fhir_hl7_connector." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure full coverage of the client's requirements, our would need to verify that our fhir_hl7_connector meets all the necessary standards and protocols for HL7 and FHIR compliance, and potentially make adaptations or improvements to our fhir_hl7_connector if needed." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must contextualise The solution answers to the staff member's request. 3.2 Drafting assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, while Our current platform, Atelier is designed to be highly available, with an active-active setup across two availability zones and a target availability of 99.9%, our would need to review our current hosting options to ensure our current hosting options align with the client's requirements for high availability and compliance with regulatory requirements such as data sovereignty and hosting within the European Union. our sovereign HDS tier on OuraneCloud meets some of regulatory requirements such as data sovereignty and hosting within the European Union, being SecNumCloud-qualified, HDS-certified, and the European Union-only." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, while our current technology stack provides a solid foundation for meeting the client's requirements, some verification and potential adaptations would be necessary to ensure full coverage, particularly with regards to integration and compliance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender demands strict GDPR compliance, data sovereignty, and the protection of sensitive health data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender also requires hosting on SecNumCloud-qualified infrastructure or equivalent, within the European Union, without dependency on non-European suppliers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How do our security controls, certifications (e.g., HDS for French health data hosting), and experience with the European Union regulatory frameworks (GDPR, EU AI Act) ensure compliance with these stringent requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As a Security and Compliance officer at our, I can confirm that our have implemented robust security controls to ensure the protection of sensitive health data. our hold the HDS certification for French health data hosting, which demonstrates our ability to handle sensitive health data in accordance with French regulations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our infrastructure is hosted on OuraneCloud, a SecNumCloud-qualified sovereign cloud, ensuring that data is stored and processed within the European Union. our certifications include ISO 27001, which covers the development, delivery, and operations of our services, as well as ISO 27701 for privacy information management. our also have experience with the European Union regulatory frameworks, including GDPR, having delivered solutions to public-sector and health clients handling special-category health data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of data protection measures, our employ encryption in transit using TLS 1.3 and encryption at rest using AES-256. our also use pseudonymisation, data minimisation, and configurable retention policies to ensure the secure handling of sensitive data. our tenant isolation approach provides strict separation between client corpora, with per-engagement logical separation. our have a Data Protection Officer (DPO) appointed and maintain a data processing register, with Data Processing Agreements (DPAs) available and aligned with GDPR Article 28. our security controls include secure software development lifecycle practices, such as code review, dependency scanning, secrets management, and periodic penetration testing by an external CREST-equivalent provider." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given secure software development lifecycle practices, such as code review, dependency scanning, secrets management, and periodic penetration testing by an external CREST-equivalent provider, our are confident that our security controls, certifications, and experience with the European Union regulatory frameworks ensure compliance with The tender stringent requirements for GDPR compliance, data sovereignty, and protection of sensitive health data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The proposed solution must comply with regulatory requirements, including GDPR, and ensure that decisions are not automated without explicit validation by a qualified professional." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must assist the drafting of clinical and administrative content, notably discharge summaries and medical reports (comptes-rendus), medical correspondence and patient letters, administrative documents and dossier syntheses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How do our legal standing, procurement experience across EU jurisdictions, IP model, insurance, standard contractual clauses, and AI regulatory posture align with the tender's legal and regulatory demands?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Faber IA, is a Société par actions simplifiée (SAS) registered in France, with Our company, Faber IA, registered office in Paris." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Faber IA, have experience with public procurement in France, having worked with local authorities, a hospital group, and a national professional body, and are familiar with the French Code de la commande publique and framework agreements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of intellectual property, our Atelier platform is proprietary software owned by Our company, Faber IA,, licensed to clients under a subscription or usage model for the contract term. our also utilize open-source components under permissive licenses and provide a Software Bill of Materials (SBOM) to clients." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding data protection, our comply with GDPR requirements, including Article 9 special-category data and Article 28 processing agreements. our Atelier platform ensures that client data is protected, and our maintain a reversibility plan for the return and deletion of client data at the end of the contract. our have professional liability insurance covering up to €10 million per claim and general civil liability cover." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Certificates are available upon request.  our regulatory compliance is maintained by our Security & Compliance function, particularly in the context of health deployments, where our monitor obligations such as GDPR, medical confidentiality, HDS framework, and EU AI Act requirements for AI systems used in a healthcare context." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given obligations such as GDPR, medical confidentiality, HDS framework, and EU AI Act requirements for AI systems used in a healthcare context, our legal standing, procurement experience, IP model, insurance coverage, and regulatory compliance posture align with the tender's demands regarding compliance with regulatory requirements, including GDPR, and ensuring that decisions are not automated without explicit validation by a qualified professional." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client's global budget for this project is estimated at €900,000 over 5 years, with an emphasis on controlled annual operating costs compatible with The client's budgetary capacity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our pricing model, current financial position, and the need to minimize total costs while ensuring high-quality service delivery, what is our projected margin on this project, and are there cost-optimization strategies our can propose? our target gross margin percentage ranges from 25% to 35%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given The client's global budget of €900,000 over 5 years, our need to ensure that our pricing model aligns with The client's budgetary constraints while maintaining our desired margin." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Generated content must be adapted to the clinical/administrative context and conform to expected quality standards. 3.3 Dossier-handling assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The budget envelope indicates that one-off project costs should account for approximately 30% of the total budget, which is €270,000, and recurring run costs should account for around 70%, which is €630,000, over the 5-year period." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To minimize total costs, our can propose cost-efficient tiers and models. our context notes that \"The sovereign HDS tier and the sovereign European model are more cost-efficient on the recurring side than the premium high-availability tier combined with top-tier proprietary inference.\" are suggests our can offer a solution that not only meets but potentially exceeds The client's expectations for cost control by leveraging these cost-efficient options." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Assuming our can maintain our desired margin, if our aim for the lower end of our target range (25%) to be more competitive and ensure high-quality service delivery while minimizing costs, our projected revenue from this project would need to be such that 25% of our projected revenue from this contract represents our margin." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, without specific details on how the €900,000 is to be allocated beyond the one-off vs. recurring split, our must consider our standard daily rates and how our standard daily rates apply to the services required. our pricing model includes standard daily rates for various roles, but to project our desired margin accurately, our'd need to know the exact mix of services (and thus personnel) required by the client." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nonetheless, given that our financial capacity note suggests our are above typical thresholds for a €900,000 contract and have a comfortable cash runway from our Series A funding, our are in a good position to negotiate and deliver this project while maintaining our desired margins." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Therefore, without precise allocation details but considering our target range and The client's emphasis on controlled costs, our would aim to ensure that our proposal not only fits within The client's budget but also allows our to operate within our desired margin." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk136> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This could involve proposing a phased implementation to manage costs effectively, leveraging our cost-efficient tiers and models, and ensuring transparent costing to demonstrate value for money spent." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk137> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given the constraints and requirements, especially regarding data sovereignty, integration with existing systems, and environmental considerations, our can tailor our proposal to meet the constraints and requirements, especially regarding data sovereignty, integration with existing systems, and environmental considerations while optimizing costs. tailor might involve highlighting how our proposal can contribute to reducing energy consumption, relying on low-carbon infrastructure, and ensuring compliance with all regulatory requirements, thus addressing multiple aspects of The client's constraints and preferences." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk138> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution should demonstrate innovation in AI, adapt generated content to clinical and administrative contexts, and ensure explainability and transparency of recommendations or suggestions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk139> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How does our LLM stack, RAG capabilities, fine-tuning methods, and performance benchmarks support the creation of an innovative and effective AI assistance tool for healthcare professionals?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk14> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must assist staff in analysing and handling dossiers by surfacing relevant information, recalling applicable rules, and suggesting actions or verifications." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk140> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Faber IA, has a strong foundation in AI innovation, which is essential for creating an effective AI assistance tool for healthcare professionals." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk141> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Faber IA core approach is based on Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG), where every answer is generated from passages retrieved from the client's controlled corpus, and the answer cites passages retrieved from the client's controlled corpus." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk142> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This grounding behavior ensures that Our company, Faber IA responses are explainable and transparent." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk143> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Faber IA RAG capabilities include hybrid retrieval, re-ranking, query reformulation, multi-document synthesis, structured extraction, template-guided drafting, applicable rules recall during dossier handling, action and verification suggestions, and dossier-context continuity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk144> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our RAG capabilities enable Our company, Faber IA to adapt generated content to clinical and administrative contexts, providing healthcare professionals with accurate and relevant information." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk145> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Faber IA offer two model options: a Sovereign European open-weight model (self-hosted) and top-tier proprietary models (via API)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk146> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The choice between two model options: a Sovereign European open-weight model (self-hosted) and top-tier proprietary models (via API) trades performance against explainability and sovereignty, allowing Our company, Faber IA to select the best approach per engagement." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk147> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Faber IA iterative methodology involves corpus selection and curation with the client's experts, retrieval tuning, prompt and template design per use case, and evaluation loops, ensuring that Our company, Faber IA solution meets the specific needs of healthcare professionals." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk148> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Faber IA fine-tuning methods allow for optional fine-tuning on client material, which can further improve the performance of Our company, Faber IA models." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk149> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Faber IA measure answer quality using a labeled evaluation set built with the client, focusing on groundedness, relevance, and factual support." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk15> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must support medical coding (PMSI / ICD-10) for activity reporting (T2A)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk150> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Faber IA performance benchmarks demonstrate the effectiveness of Our company, Faber IA approach in reducing processing and documentation times in comparable deployments." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk151> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of innovation, our LLM stack and RAG capabilities enable Our company, Faber IA to provide a unique solution that combines the benefits of retrieval-augmented generation with the flexibility of fine-tuning on client-specific data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk152> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging Our company, Faber IA explainability features, such as source citations, retrieved passages, retrieval trace, and interaction logging, Our company, Faber IA can ensure transparency and trust in our recommendations or suggestions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

